      "content": "We would start the clock when we got on site and then it is all inclusive. So there's no trip fees or taxes. We don't have credit card fees, we pad and wrap all the furniture items to prevent any damages. Everything is also fully insured and then we will have tools on-hand to handle disassemble. Reassembly yeah, we get everything where we need, you needed to go we'll have does to be able to do those boxes as efficiently as possible. And then the way that it works, we do a two and a half hour minimum. Which would be $1,110 in this case. But once we exceed that minimum, we just bill in fifteen minute increments until the move is completed. So you would just pay for the time that was used that day. Does that all make sense?",
